---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/ai-mortgage-admin/styles.css';
import '../styles/ai-mortgage-admin/sections.css';
import '../styles/ai-mortgage-admin/motion.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Henry Accounting Admin — More clients filed. Less time lost to admin."
  description="Drop in the engagement. Henry Accounting Admin reads the records, drafts the client chase and queues the year-end."
  ogTitle="Henry Accounting Admin — More clients filed. Less time lost to admin."
  ogDescription="Drop in the engagement. Henry Accounting Admin reads the records, drafts the client chase and queues the year-end."
  includeHomeStyles={false}
>

<style is:global>
  /* Henry accent — teal. Professional accounting palette. */
  :root {
    --lime: #0D9488;
    --lime-2: #0F766E;
    --lime-ink: #FFFFFF;
    --lime-rgb: 13, 148, 136;
  }
</style>

<div class="scroll-progress"></div>
<a class="float-cta" href="#book"><span class="dot"></span>Book a call<span class="arrow">→</span></a>

<header class="wrap">
  <nav class="nav">
    <a class="nav-brand" href="#">
      <img src="/images/the-claws-logo.svg" alt="TheClaws" class="nav-brand-logo" />
      <span>Henry Accounting Admin</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#problem">Problem</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#case">Case study</a>
      <a href="#incl">Included</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" href="#book">Book a call <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="dot"></span>Records reviewed in minutes, not hours</div>
    <h1 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">More clients filed.<br><span class="mark">Less time lost to admin.</span></h1>
    <p class="sub reveal reveal-delay-2">Drop in the engagement. Henry Accounting Admin reads the records, drafts the client chase and queues the year-end.</p>
    <div class="btns reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <a class="btn btn-lime btn-magnet" href="#book">Book a call &amp; see it on your books <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#how">See how it works</a>
    </div>
    <p class="micro reveal reveal-delay-4">We'll review one live engagement on the call and show what it would have queried — bring the file, no prep needed.</p>

    <hr class="hero-divider reveal reveal-delay-4">

    <div class="hero-caps reveal reveal-delay-5">
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="8" y1="13" x2="16" y2="13"></line><line x1="8" y1="17" x2="16" y2="17"></line></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Reads the whole engagement</strong>
        <span>Bank feeds, receipts, payroll, dividends, expenses, Companies House.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Drafts the chase</strong>
        <span>Written from the actual books. You review before sending.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Fits your firm's process</strong>
        <span>Your software (Xero / QBO / Sage), your engagement letter, your tone.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-stage">
    <img class="agent" src="/images/account-manager.webp" alt="Henry Accounting Admin reviewing an engagement">
    <div class="sbubble"><span class="spark"></span> What needs attention on engagement #ACC-2847?</div>

    <div class="fcard fcard-alert">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic">!</span>
        <span>Missing items flagged</span>
        <span class="pill">4</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chip-list">
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Bank statement</b> · Q2</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>P60</b> · 2024-25</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Dividend voucher</b> · interim</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Vehicle mileage</b> · log</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fcard fcard-todo">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic">✓</span>
        <span>Todo List</span>
        <span class="pill lime">2 ITEMS</span>
      </div>
      <div class="todo-i">
        <div class="ti-head">📊 VAT return<span class="ti-pill">Drafted</span></div>
        <div class="ti-sub">Q2 figures reconciled, awaiting director sign-off</div>
      </div>
      <div class="todo-i">
        <div class="ti-head">💬 Client query<span class="ti-pill out">Reviewed</span></div>
        <div class="ti-sub">Director's loan threshold flagged early</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fcard fcard-wa">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic ic-wa" aria-label="WhatsApp">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.297-.497.1-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span>WhatsApp chase</span>
        <span class="pill">Draft</span>
      </div>
      <div class="wa-msg">Hi Mr Patel, getting your year-end ready. Could you send the Q2 bank statement, your 2024-25 P60, the interim dividend voucher, and the latest mileage log so we can finalise the figures?</div>
      <div class="wa-meta">
        <span>To: Mr Patel</span>
        <span class="send">Review &amp; send →</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="ticker-band">
  <div class="ticker">
    <span class="t-strong">What would you do with 15 extra hours a week?</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span>Because that's what the records admin is costing you.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span class="t-strong">Future accountants don't pay it anymore</span>
    <span class="t-sep">—</span>
    <span>they file what their AI already prepared.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span class="t-strong">What would you do with 15 extra hours a week?</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span>Because that's what the records admin is costing you.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span class="t-strong">Future accountants don't pay it anymore</span>
    <span class="t-sep">—</span>
    <span>they file what their AI already prepared.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="problem" class="real bg-grid bg-grid-dark">
  <div class="wrap real-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="sec-label">The problem</div>
      <h2>Your tax knowledge is not the bottleneck. <em>Records admin</em> is.</h2>
      <p>You already know the rules. What slows you down is everything around it: chasing receipts, reconciling bank feeds, classifying expenses, pulling P60s, hunting dividend vouchers, querying directors' loans, and reminding clients about deadlines.</p>
      <div class="problem-cards">
        <div class="pcard">
          <span class="pcard-k">01 / Records</span>
          <h4>Bank &amp; receipts</h4>
          <p>Reconciliations, missing receipts, mis-coded transactions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard pcard-dark">
          <span class="pcard-k">02 / Compliance</span>
          <h4>HMRC checks</h4>
          <p>VAT, PAYE, CT600, SA100 — flags before HMRC does.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard">
          <span class="pcard-k">03 / Evidence</span>
          <h4>Schedules &amp; notes</h4>
          <p>Dividend vouchers, mileage logs, expense rationale, DLA.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard pcard-lime">
          <span class="pcard-k">04 / Client work</span>
          <h4>Client chase</h4>
          <p>Draft WhatsApps, deadline reminders, query responses.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="real-col">
      <div class="transcript reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="sec-label">The real problem</div>

        <div class="transcript-stage">
          <img class="transcript-photo" src="/images/the-real-problem.png" alt="An exhausted accountant during Self Assessment season" />

          <div class="stage-overlay">
            <div class="stage-quote-wrap">
              <blockquote class="stage-quote">
                I'm capacity-capped at 80 clients — but <span class="hl">half my year is chasing them</span> for what they should already have sent.
              </blockquote>
              <div class="sig stage-sig">— Accountant using Henry Accounting Admin</div>
            </div>

            <div class="notes-wall" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="note note-1">
                <span class="note-tape"></span>
                <p>"Same client. Same missing dividend voucher. Every January."</p>
                <span class="note-attr">— Practice owner, Manchester</span>
              </div>
              <div class="note note-2 note-lime">
                <span class="note-tape"></span>
                <p>"Director's loan went £5K over without anyone flagging it. Found in March."</p>
                <span class="note-attr">— Tax advisor, Bristol</span>
              </div>
              <div class="note note-3">
                <span class="note-tape"></span>
                <p>"SA season is 60-hour weeks. My family forgets I exist in January."</p>
                <span class="note-attr">— Sole-trader accountant, London</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="body-txt">
          The admin around each engagement sets the cap. <strong>More clients means more receipts to chase</strong>, more reconciliations to do, more vouchers to track down, more deadlines to police. So the firm either stops taking new clients, or takes them and pays for it with January nights.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fixes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="fixes-head reveal">
      <div class="sec-label fixes-eyebrow">
        <svg class="sl-ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0Z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
        Why the usual fixes do not work
      </div>
      <h2>Hiring a junior takes months. Templates <em>do not read the bank feed</em>. Generic AI does not know a P11D from a P60.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="fix-row reveal reveal-delay-2">
      <div class="fix-card fc-fail">
        <span class="fc-badge fc-x" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h4>A junior accountant</h4>
        <p>Costs a full salary before they're useful. Needs training on Xero, your engagement letter, your file structure and your tone. Still leaves the senior reviewing the work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fix-card fc-fail">
        <span class="fc-badge fc-x" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h4>Spreadsheet checklists</h4>
        <p>Generic "please send your records" reminders. They do not look at the books, do not know what's actually missing, and the client either ignores them or sends the wrong thing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fix-card fc-fail">
        <span class="fc-badge fc-x" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h4>Generic AI chatbots</h4>
        <p>Wait for you to explain the engagement from scratch every time. They do not understand directors' loan thresholds, salary/dividend split, or why a P11D matters for a benefit-in-kind.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fits-box reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <span class="fits-pill">
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
        How it fits
      </span>
      <div class="fits-body">
        <h3>A review and drafting layer. You stay the accountant on the engagement.</h3>
        <div class="fits-body-copy">
          <p>Every flag, every chase, every draft is reviewed by you before anything moves. Henry Accounting Admin does not file, submit, or sign anything off.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fix-row fix-row-win">
        <div class="fix-card fc-win">
          <span class="fc-badge fc-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h4>You decide what gets filed</h4>
          <p>It drafts, queries, and flags. It does not submit to HMRC or Companies House without you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fix-card fc-win">
          <span class="fc-badge fc-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h4>Built for UK practice</h4>
          <p>VAT, PAYE, CT600, SA100, P11Ds, DLA, dividends. Reads Xero/QBO/Sage. Not generic bookkeeping.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fix-card fc-win">
          <span class="fc-badge fc-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="9" y1="13" x2="15" y2="13"/><line x1="9" y1="17" x2="13" y2="17"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h4>Fits your firm's process</h4>
          <p>Your engagement letter, your fee scale, your file naming, your tone. Configured at setup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how" class="how bg-grid">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-label reveal">How it works</div>
    <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Four steps from messy records to <em>filing-ready.</em></h2>

    <div class="how-flow">
      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step one</span>
        <h3>Connect the engagement</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="doc-mock">
            <span class="doc-line w70"></span>
            <span class="doc-line w50"></span>
            <span class="doc-line w65"></span>
            <span class="doc-block"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Xero / QBO / Sage feed plus uploaded receipts, payslips, P60s, dividend vouchers and Companies House data.</p>
        <span class="hs-tag">Drop the books</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step two</span>
        <h3>Henry Accounting Admin reviews</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="review-mock">
            <div class="rm-card-back"></div>
            <div class="rm-card">
              <span class="rm-head"></span>
              <span class="rm-line w60"></span>
              <span class="rm-line w45"></span>
              <span class="rm-reply" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 10 20 15 15 20"/><path d="M4 4v7a4 4 0 0 0 4 4h12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Reconciles the feed, classifies expenses, flags missing receipts, queries odd entries.</p>
        <span class="hs-tag">Full review</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step three</span>
        <h3>You get flags, queries &amp; drafts</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="chips-mock">
            <span class="cm-chip cm-1">Missing receipt</span>
            <span class="cm-chip cm-2">DLA over £10K</span>
            <span class="cm-chip cm-3">Mileage gap</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Review the queries, approve the WhatsApp chase, decide what goes to the client.</p>
        <span class="hs-tag">Clear queries</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-5">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step four</span>
        <h3>You file a cleaner return</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
