      <div class="qa reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="qa-head">
          <span class="qn">Q2</span>
          <h4>Will it work with Xero / QBO / Sage?</h4>
          <span class="qa-tog">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-body"><p>Yes. Use it alongside your existing software as a review and chase layer. It fits around your current process.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="qa-head">
          <span class="qn">Q3</span>
          <h4>What about client data and AML?</h4>
          <span class="qa-tog">+</span>
        </div>
